{"evidence":[{"sentence_id":0,"text":"Hollis/Brookline High School is a public school located in Hollis, New Hampshire, serving the towns of Hollis and Brookline.","title":"Hollis/Brookline High School"},{"sentence_id":1,"text":" It is administered by New Hampshire School Administration Unit (SAU) 41.","title":"Hollis/Brookline High School"},{"sentence_id":0,"text":"The Ohio Hi-Point Career Center is a career–technical school that provides career–technical training to high school students and adults in west-central Ohio.","title":"Ohio Hi-Point Career Center"},{"sentence_id":1,"text":" Founded in 1974, Ohio Hi-Point (OHP) Career Center in Bellefontaine, Ohio, is a two-year career-technical school district serving 11th and 12th grade students in 14 partner school districts covering five counties, which comprises the career-technical planning district (CTPD).","title":"Ohio Hi-Point Career Center"},{"sentence_id":2,"text":" Students may also opt to remain at their partner school and specialize in one of Ohio High-Point’s fifty-two satellite programs.","title":"Ohio Hi-Point Career Center"},{"sentence_id":3,"text":" Career-technical programs offered at OHP are in the career fields of agriculture and animal science, arts and communication, business, engineering and manufacturing, health sciences, human and public service and transportation.","title":"Ohio Hi-Point Career Center"},{"sentence_id":4,"text":" The high school services students from Bellefontaine High School, Benjamin Logan High School, Indian Lake High School, Waynesfield-Goshen High School, Upper Scioto Valley High School, Riverside High School, Mechanicsburg High School, Triad High School, Kenton High School, Ridgemont High School, Urbana High School, Marysville High School, West Liberty-Salem High School, and Graham High School.","title":"Ohio Hi-Point Career Center"},{"sentence_id":0,"text":"Elias Korcoulis, known to his friends as Lou and to thousands others as Coach (1940 – March 4, 2006) was the cross-country and track coach for Hollis/Brookline High School in Hollis, New Hampshire from 1962 until his death.","title":"Elias &quot;Coach&quot; Korcoulis"},{"sentence_id":1,"text":" Coach was an alumnus of Manchester High School Central, having lived in Manchester all his life.","title":"Elias &quot;Coach&quot; Korcoulis"},{"sentence_id":2,"text":" Coach would then go on to Phillips Exeter Academy and Keene State College.","title":"Elias &quot;Coach&quot; Korcoulis"},{"sentence_id":3,"text":" He began working at Hollis/Brookline in 1962 and started the cross-country, winter track, and spring track programs.","title":"Elias &quot;Coach&quot; Korcoulis"},{"sentence_id":4,"text":" During his career, Coach led the Hollis/Brookline Cavaliers to twenty-six state championships.","title":"Elias &quot;Coach&quot; Korcoulis"},{"sentence_id":0,"text":"Someshwara Wildlife Sanctuary is a protected wildlife sanctuary in the Western Ghats of Karnataka state in India.","title":"Someshwara Wildlife Sanctuary"},{"sentence_id":1,"text":" It is named after the presiding deity "Lord Someshwara" of the famed Someshwara temple located within the sanctuary.","title":"Someshwara Wildlife Sanctuary"},{"sentence_id":2,"text":" The sanctuary lies in Udupi & Shivamogga districts of Karnataka, below Agumbe.","title":"Someshwara Wildlife Sanctuary"},{"sentence_id":3,"text":" The sanctuary houses Sitanadi nature camp run by Karnataka Forest Department.","title":"Someshwara Wildlife Sanctuary"},{"sentence_id":4,"text":" Udupi to Agumbe road passes through this wildlife sanctuary.","title":"Someshwara Wildlife Sanctuary"},{"sentence_id":5,"text":" The nearest town is Hebri which is connected by bus service to Udupi, Mangaluru and Bengaluru on a daily basis.","title":"Someshwara Wildlife Sanctuary"},{"sentence_id":0,"text":"Nambor - Doigrung Wildlife Sanctuary () is a Morangi located in Golaghat district of Assam in India.","title":"Nambor - Doigrung Wildlife Sanctuary"},{"sentence_id":1,"text":" This wildlife sanctuary covers an area of 97.15 km.","title":"Nambor - Doigrung Wildlife Sanctuary"},{"sentence_id":2,"text":" It is located 25 km from Golaghat town and about 318 km from Guwahati LGBI Airport.","title":"Nambor - Doigrung Wildlife Sanctuary"},{"sentence_id":3,"text":" The forest type is tropical semi-evergreen with pockets of pure evergreen, interspersed with small forest marshes.","title":"Nambor - Doigrung Wildlife Sanctuary"},{"sentence_id":4,"text":" The area was declared as a Wildlife sanctuary in 2003.","title":"Nambor - Doigrung Wildlife Sanctuary"},{"sentence_id":5,"text":" The sanctuary along with Garampani Wildlife Sanctuary (6  km) and Nambor Wildlife Sanctuary (37 km) are a part of the Kaziranga-Karbi Anglong Elephant Reserve, which was declared on 17 April 2003, with an estimated area of 3,270 km.","title":"Nambor - Doigrung Wildlife Sanctuary"},{"sentence_id":0,"text":"Brookline is a town in Hillsborough County, New Hampshire, United States.","title":"Brookline, New Hampshire"},{"sentence_id":1,"text":" The population was 4,991 at the 2010 census.","title":"Brookline, New Hampshire"},{"sentence_id":2,"text":" Brookline is home to the Talbot-Taylor Wildlife Sanctuary, Potanipo Pond, and the Brookline Covered Bridge.","title":"Brookline, New Hampshire"}],"peer_messages":["Unverified peer answer: Talbot-Taylor Wildlife Sanctuary
